      "adopted_name": "NEW_YORK_WEEKDAY_DISTRIBUTIONAL_HETEROGENEITY",
      "adopted_statement": "Within the admitted corpus, weekday buckets differ descriptively; Friday has higher tick_count and minute_range quantiles than Sunday, while Saturday has no admitted observations.",
